**Title of the project :**
•	 Smart Student & Parent Management System
•	Designed and developed a web-based platform to streamline the academic and administrative system and parent-student interaction.
• The system allows leave management, academic monitoring,     notifications, and efficient communication through an intuitive user interface.


**Description:**
Edulinkr – Educational Management System is a web-based platform designed to simplify and centralize educational information management. It provides a common platform for students, parents, and administrators to access important academic information and educational updates.

The system allows users to access student profiles, marks, GPA, courses, events, and industry updates through a simple and user-friendly interface. Administrators can manage educational information, while parents can conveniently monitor their student's academic progress.

The main objective of Edulinkr is to improve access to academic information, simplify educational management, and strengthen communication between students, parents, and administrators.

